            and by the bootstrap and shims at run time: downloaded once, verified, cached
          </text>

          <!-- left column: dwarfs-t → dwarfs-t-rs → product -->
          <g transform="translate(10, 104)">
            <rect width="270" height="88" rx="10" fill="var(--tb-c-card)" stroke="var(--tb-c-divider-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <text x="135" y="24" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display), sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="var(--tb-c-text-1)">dwarfs-t — the only C++</text>
